        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "50aa8f77",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "# Inflation & Interest Rates: Are Savers Keeping Up?\n",
                "\n",
                "This dashboard compares headline CPI, core CPI, and the federal funds rate to show how inflation and monetary policy have moved together, and whether the interest rate has kept pace with rising prices.\n",
                "\n",
                "**What you'll find here**\n",
                "\n",
                "- Year-over-year headline vs. core inflation (core excludes food and energy)\n",
                "- The fed funds rate over time\n",
                "- A real rate proxy (fed funds rate minus headline inflation): positive means rates are running ahead of inflation"
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 12,
            "height": 4
          }
        },
